# 第20章 四套 Commentary 全文閱讀回執

## raw_data/ccbiblestudy_CT_joshua_20.txt
- 行數：148
- 引句：『報血仇人』指本著以命償命的原則，為死者報仇的至近親屬。
- 引句：『寄居的外人』表示寄居的外邦人也同樣可以獲得逃城的豁免權。
- 引句：「哥蘭」(8節)：字義喜樂；因信滿有榮光的大喜樂(彼前一8)。

## raw_data/ccbiblestudy_GT_joshua_20.txt
- 行數：135
- 引句：波爾金注意到，約但河西只指定三座逃城，而非六座，可以肯定約書亞記十三1所提，全地尚未完全征服。
- 引句：●「分定」：原文是「分別為聖」、「奉獻出」。
- 引句：第二、所有障礙物都要清除，免得對他的腳構成危險和阻礙他的速度；

## raw_data/kingcomments_joshua_20.txt
- 行數：43
- 引句：In one case there is only a guilty hand, in the other case there is also a guilty heart.
- 引句：The three cities on the wilderness side of the Jordan are mentioned again, according to their location from south to north.
- 引句：The cities of refuge are also Levite cities.

## raw_data/biblehub_study_joshua_20.txt
- 行數：314
- 引句：The cities of refuge limited that role by placing judgment in the hands of the congregation.
- 引句：Ramoth-gilead stood in the central Transjordan and later became a strategically important city in Israel’s conflicts with Syria (1 Kings 22:3–4).
- 引句：God’s provision applied equally to native Israelites and resident foreigners.


